          "text": "Témoignages: JOUE-LES-TOURS (37) 17.12.2009",
          "text_sha256": "f5ab7d72af420f8420c119b6c8653c5631c063492a0bdce103d62e41411d6e9a"
        },
        {
          "end_ms": null,
